1. required checks green on the head;
2. readiness VERIFIED;
3. the newest master run of every workflow is green;
4. the open-PR queue is drained;
5. no stranded local work;
6. every red workflow or blind spot is tracked;
7. the required lanes are stable;
8. repository security settings are on.
Per-layer 'production ready' is defined in _handoff/readiness/README.md and is recorded in LEDGER.md, which is on master (critic correction).

